top, an available source for compact-set finite measure. Remaining necessary work is to draft the full graph revision, including N001 exports and ambient measure conventions, R004 direct support inputs/declarations and proof of all theorem hypotheses, R001 zero integral proof, R003 empty compact-set bound, source-list cleanup, and then structural check and fresh Audit A. The existing inputs do not imply a counterexample or a judged unsupported theorem; this report records progress only.\\\",\\\"basis\\\":\\\"Probe output and official source read in this stage, together with the six explicitly frozen task documents and declared NL0/Yui rules.\\\",\\\"partial_progress\\\":\\\"M010 successful probe; source read at Mathlib/Analysis/Calculus/LineDeriv/IntegrationByParts.lean:1-80. M011 successful probe for IsCompact.measure_lt_top; source read at Mathlib/MeasureTheory/Measure/Typeclasses/Finite.lean:331-343. No artifact check or submission yet.\\\"}\"}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[{"type":"function","name":"search_mathlib","description":"在固定 mathlib 的 Lean 源码中搜索正则表达式，返回至多 100 行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_mathlib","description":"读取固定 mathlib 中一个 Mathlib/...lean 文件的指定行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start_line":{"type":"integer"},"line_count":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start_line","line_count"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_task_input","description":"Read an explicitly frozen task document by ID; no other local files are accessible.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["id","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false